{'symbol': 'ED', 'date': '2022-06-09 12:10:00', 'title': 'CON EDISON SUSTAINABILITY REPORT: LEADING THE CLEAN ENERGY TRANSITION', 'text': "DELIVERING AN ENERGY GRID FOR A RESILIENT AND RENEWABLE FUTURE NEW YORK , JUNE 9, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CON EDISON HAS RELEASED ITS ANNUAL SUSTAINABILITY REPORT, DETAILING THE COMPANY'S PROGRESS IN PREPARING ITS ENERGY GRID FOR THE RENEWABLE FUTURE, LAYING THE GROUNDWORK FOR ELECTRIC VEHICLE CHARGING, AND ENSURING ITS WORKFORCE REFLECTS THE RICH DIVERSITY OF THE COMMUNITIES IT SERVES.\xa0 IN 2021 CON EDISON EXPANDED ITS CLEAN ENERGY COMMITMENT, PLEDGING TO DELIVER 100 PERCENT CLEAN POWER BY 2040 AND REIMAGINE ITS GAS-DELIVERY SYSTEM IN EFFORTS TO DECARBONIZE TOWARD A NET-ZERO FUTURE."}